 "lab": {
  "title": "VLAN: разделение отделов",
  "text": "Отдел продаж (PC1, PC2) и отдел кадров (PC3, PC4) подключены к одному коммутатору и пока видят друг друга.\n\n1. Создайте на **SW1** VLAN 10 с именем `SALES` и VLAN 20 с именем `HR`.\n2. Порты Fa0/1–Fa0/2 переведите в режим access во VLAN 10, порты Fa0/3–Fa0/4 во VLAN 20.\n3. Убедитесь, что PC1 видит PC2, а PC3 из другого отдела больше не отвечает.\n\nАдреса ПК уже заданы: 192.168.1.11–14/24.",
  "checks": [
   "vlan SW1 10 | На SW1 есть VLAN 10",
   "vlan SW1 20 | На SW1 есть VLAN 20",
   "access SW1 Fa0/1 10 | Fa0/1 во VLAN 10",
   "access SW1 Fa0/2 10 | Fa0/2 во VLAN 10",
   "access SW1 Fa0/3 20 | Fa0/3 во VLAN 20",
   "access SW1 Fa0/4 20 | Fa0/4 во VLAN 20",
   "ping PC1 192.168.1.12 | PC1 видит PC2",
   "ping PC3 192.168.1.14 | PC3 видит PC4",
   "noping PC1 192.168.1.13 | PC1 не видит PC3 (другой VLAN)"
  ],
  "translations": {
   "en": {
    "title": "VLAN: separating departments",
    "text": "Sales (PC1, PC2) and HR (PC3, PC4) share one switch and can still see each other.\n\n1. On **SW1** create VLAN 10 named `SALES` and VLAN 20 named `HR`.\n2. Make Fa0/1–Fa0/2 access ports in VLAN 10 and Fa0/3–Fa0/4 access ports in VLAN 20.\n3. Check that PC1 reaches PC2 while PC3 from the other department no longer answers.\n\nThe PC addresses are already set: 192.168.1.11–14/24.",
    "checks": [
     "SW1 has VLAN 10",
     "SW1 has VLAN 20",
     "Fa0/1 is in VLAN 10",
     "Fa0/2 is in VLAN 10",
     "Fa0/3 is in VLAN 20",
     "Fa0/4 is in VLAN 20",
     "PC1 reaches PC2",
     "PC3 reaches PC4",
     "PC1 cannot reach PC3 (other VLAN)"
    ]
   }
  },
  "solution": "Каждому отделу свой VLAN, порты в режиме access.",
  "script": {
   "SW1": "enable\nconfigure terminal\nvlan 10\nname SALES\nvlan 20\nname HR\nexit\ninterface range fa0/1 - 2\nswitchport mode access\nswitchport access vlan 10\nexit\ninterface range fa0/3 - 4\nswitchport mode access\nswitchport access vlan 20\nend"
  }
 }
}